                <pb facs="0325" n="205" xml:id="pg205"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Rockhill to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-07-01"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 1,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Rockhill reports that orders have been issued by the Chinese foreign office
                    to all viceroys and governors to stop the attempted boycott on American goods
                    and the anti-American agitation.)</p>
            </div>
